      },
      {
        "text": "And behold, O Lord, in them there is no light; whither shall we steer? And also we shall perish, for in them we cannot breathe, save it is the air which is in them; therefore we shall perish.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
